<h2 id="why-partner-with-pinnacle">Why Partner With Pinnacle Sales in Portland</h2>
<p>If you run a kitchen & bath showroom or design studio in Portland, Pinnacle Sales gives you a portfolio that spans every market tier — from semi-custom value to handleless German luxury — backed by 23+ years of hands-on dealer support. We offer protected territory, line training, and the design and merchandising help your team needs to win high-end remodel and new-build projects.</p>

<h2 id="lines-you-can-carry">Premium Lines You Can Carry</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — Custom paint and wood species for transitional and PNW-modern kitchens, with strong dealer margins.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access for clean contemporary remodels.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Handleless European fronts for high-end West Hills and Lake Oswego homes, with protected territory.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Semi-custom value for residential and ADU projects.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="portland-market-opportunity">The Portland Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>From the West Hills and Lake Oswego to the close-in eastside neighborhoods, Portland kitchens favor Pacific-Northwest modern — natural materials, warm neutrals, and clean, understated detailing. Two-tone schemes and warm-wood islands are popular across the city's many craftsman and mid-century remodels, while higher-end West Hills and Lake Oswego projects favor <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> and handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm</a> kitchens. Portland's deep, design-forward remodel culture makes it a strong market for dealers carrying the right lines.</p>

